-- Source module: Solutions.KFV4Round
/-!
# KFV §6: one round of Lemma 16 in IL

A round of the computed forward procedure on coefficients is
`compRc p Sb Ex = twLc Ex ∘ layerQc p Sb` (`KFV1Coef`), the opposite round is
`compRIc p Sb Ex = layerQc p Sb ∘ twLc (-Ex)`.

* `LayerOK code T N r p W cost`: on every clean state holding a record array `zs` (scale `p`,
