-- Source module: Solutions.KFUURot3
/-!
# KFUU §7c: the loops of the uniform table set-up

* `coefL_sp`: `i` steps of `coefB` (counter `oCC`, count `oI = i`);
* `stgL_sp`: `i` uniform stages `stageU` of KIL4 (counter `oCS`), which turn the stage stacks
