# KFUU §2c: phase 1 of the uniform reversal

`p1U pM pS` (sizes `S = shP u bs` on `pS` in order, `n = |bs|` on `nR`, `2^u` on `rU2`, `cz` on
`rCZ`) moves every extra bit behind the main atoms: `Dl (lay1 n) ↦ Dl (lay1 0)`.
